{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217160","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621716001:1":{"text":"길로드 씨... 미안해요. 저희가 경솔하게 굴어서 잘리게 됐나 봐요.","source_cn":"吉罗德……对不起，都怪我们不小心，害得你被辞退了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C9919C8DE6A194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621716002:1":{"text":"나쁜 사장님! 분명 찔려서 자른 거잖아요. 길로드 씨는 좋은 사람인데!","source_cn":"那个大坏蛋老板，他肯定是心虚了才辞退你的！你是好人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x734C64B65A707F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621716003:1":{"text":"아르바이트를 못 해서 생활비가 부족하면, 제 용돈 다 줄게요!","source_cn":"要是没有兼职，生活费不够的话，我可以把零花钱都给你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D678307099F24A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621716004:1":{"text":"하하... 고마워요. 하지만 마음만 받을게요. 그래도 저한테는 별일 없을 거예요. 안 그래도 사장님이랑 안 맞아서 그만둘 생각이었거든요.","source_cn":"哈哈……谢谢，你们的好意我心领了。不过别担心，这件事对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B2C671A084122F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621716005:1":{"text":"오늘 일은 오히려 제가 고마운걸요. 사장님의 거짓말을 밝히는 걸 도와줘서 귀중한 증거를 모을 수 있었어요.","source_cn":"今天这件事，我还要谢谢你们呢。感谢你们配合我拆穿了老板...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4CBC9BF76C83673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621716006:1":{"text":"신고 자료 준비는 저에게 맡겨주세요. 반드시 대가를 치르게 만들게요.","source_cn":"准备举报材料的事就交给我吧，我一定会让他得到应有的教训。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7744D801EC2ED47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621716007:1":{"text":"작전 성공을 기념해서 근처에서 같이 점심 먹을래요? 축하 파티라도 해야죠.","source_cn":"为了庆祝我们的作战计划圆满成功，中午一起去附近吃个午餐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F976351D6287FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621716008:1":{"text":"좋아요, 좋아요! 그럼 저희가 쏠게요!","source_cn":"好啊好啊！这顿我们请客！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C6B29262FADF3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赛琳":{"text":"세이린","source":"赛琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:利奥":{"text":"리온","source":"利奥","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雷蒙德":{"text":"레이먼드","source":"雷蒙德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吉罗德":{"text":"길로드","source":"吉罗德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}